Declare the sip module ABI that QtCore, and every module importing it, is
generated for. sip 6.16.1 refuses a module that targets an ABI major version
without a %MinimumABIVersion naming it.

--- a/sip/QtCore/QtCoremod.sip
+++ b/sip/QtCore/QtCoremod.sip
@@ -65,6 +65,8 @@
 
 %Plugin PyQt5
 
+%MinimumABIVersion "12.15"
+
 %If (Py_v3)
 %DefaultEncoding "ASCII"
 %End
